name 'ai-and-algorithmic-decisions-preassessment-q15_2026'

question 'A student asks AI to fix a bug in their game. The AI suggests a code change. The student pastes it in, but the game still doesn\'t work. What should the student do next?'

wrong 'Ask the AI for a totally different solution and paste that one in.'
wrong 'Assume the original bug is unfixable and start over.'
wrong 'Restart the computer.'
right 'Read the AI''s code carefully, predict what it should do, test step by step, and find where the logic actually breaks.'

allow_multiple_attempts true

